gamemate-commentary-v2.gguf is a LoRA adapter for LFM2.5-1.2B-Instruct by Liquid AI, Inc.

It was made by GameMate by fine-tuning that model on hand-written comments for game moments, so it
is a modified version of the model. It is distributed under the LFM Open License v1.0 in the
LICENSE file next to it.

GameMate downloads the base model itself from Liquid AI's page on Hugging Face:
https://huggingface.co/LiquidAI/LFM2.5-1.2B-Instruct-GGUF
